  (text "wifi-comm-pac Rev A - O1NEXT WiFi COMM PAC (issues #324, #325, part of #56)" (at 30 352 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "c0ad37ff-05e6-4159-8f59-c55f9f70045a"))
  (text "J1 is a 2x5 IDC: pin n = DE-9 pin n for 1..9; pin 10 is spare." (at 30 358 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "91466b03-7f6f-47aa-96ba-1e8539983036"))
  (text "Pin 7 is +12.6 V DC direct from the machine (2.02 A rail), NOT via R21." (at 30 364 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "c4eb3aa3-0858-4b37-9efa-dde45f0e6309"))
  (text "U1/U2 translate the 5 V TTL side; U3 is the open-drain MSB sink." (at 30 370 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "453c2299-b896-497e-a6c0-eb8f8f328311"))
  (text "U4 MAX3232 runs on 3V3 so its drivers swing +/-5.5 V into the bipolar RXD." (at 30 376 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "607abc10-767f-4ef3-89a8-84022053a990"))
  (text "U6 = panel expander 0x58 (P0 push-pull CC, P1 open-drain). U7 = handshake 0x59." (at 30 382 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "a692f211-931e-4b9c-9ab4-ac986975f756"))
  (text "Both expanders are fitted: neither is full, so the pin budget is closed." (at 30 388 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "947f7ec6-92eb-4da7-a1e5-44a799a5b8b8"))
  (text "Audio is MAX98357A on +5V. Power is diode-OR: 12.6V path and USB-C path." (at 30 394 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "3371ad10-6393-474f-8c66-f49417fc7e3f"))
  (text "IC pin numbers here are LOGICAL; bind them at footprint annotation." (at 30 400 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "91a26232-ca59-425a-b7a2-61a9f2b58aa1"))
